    "description":"DescriptionDenso K20PR-U11 Standard Spark PlugThe spark plugs are what supply the spark that ignites the air\/fuel mixture, creating the explosion which makes your engine produce power. New spark plugs, for instance, keep your engine at its peak and efficiency levels.Benefits of replacing spark plugsThe primary benefit is knowing your car will start without a hitch. Needless to say, that’s not all that matters. New spark plugs provide a lot of other performance benefits as well.1.Firstly, consistent production of optimal combustion. Fully functioning spark plugs equate a fully functioning combustion system. Get this operating successfully, and a lot of performance issues you’re experiencing could be a distant memory.2. Secondly, better fuel economy. The National Institute for Automotive Service Excellence says misfiring spark plugs can reduce fuel efficiency by 30%. New plugs, when replaced at specified intervals, maximize fuel economy and save some dough.3. Thirdly, smooth and energetic starts. The first time you turn the ignition with a new spark plug can be an eye-opening experience. That old spark plug may have been the reason your car was experiencing those jerky starts.4. Fourth, less harmful emissions. The Environmental Protection Agency states that regular engine tune-ups—especially in regard to spark plugs—not only save gas but also reduce air pollution. That’s a win-win.5. Lastly, reduces the risk of catalytic converter failure.Polish Venture says NO to COUNTERFEIT!80% of spark plugs sold in Kenya today are counterfeit. Know how to spot the fake and avoid damaging your engine.Popular spark plug manufacturers such as NGK, Denso, Bosch, for example, give iridium spark plugs a life expectancy of 40,000 to 50,000km but typically last longer. Nickel spark plugs on the other hand last 10,000 to 20,000km.Know How To Spot The FakeBuy genuine Denso K20PR-U11 Standard Spark Plug at the best price in Nairobi, KenyaShop for service partsCheck out our Car AccessoriesShop for Suspension PartsFollow us onFacebookfor the latest offers!",
